# Bind hostapd headers to the same OpenSSL tree its linker already uses.
# The separate supplicant already has this include path; give its package
# an explicit OpenSSL producer edge as well.
diff --git a/release/src-rt-5.02axhnd/bcmdrivers/broadcom/net/wl/impl51/main/components/opensource/router_tools/hostapd/hostapd/Makefile b/release/src-rt-5.02axhnd/bcmdrivers/broadcom/net/wl/impl51/main/components/opensource/router_tools/hostapd/hostapd/Makefile
